§ `Top-level goal`

g01g MEANS grT `(a) unjustifiable dismissal` (Date 3 2 2027) (Date 3 2 2027) (Date 3 5 2027) FALSE FALSE
g01e MEANS hiEmp 80000 364 200000 FALSE
g01 MEANS `the grievance position for` g01e `, grievance` g01g `, remedies` (rf FALSE FALSE 0 10000 15000)

-- G01
#ASSERT NOT (g01's `barred by a trial provision or the threshold`)
#ASSERT g01's `raised in time`
#ASSERT (g01's `last day to raise`) EQUALS Date 3 5 2027
#ASSERT (g01's `last day to commence an action`) EQUALS Date 3 5 2030
-- G02
#ASSERT (`the grievance position for` (trial27 (Date 1 5 2027) FALSE) `, grievance` dismissA `, remedies` (rf FALSE FALSE 0 10000 15000))'s `barred by a trial provision or the threshold`
-- G03
#ASSERT (`the grievance position for` (hiEmp 200000 364 200000 FALSE) `, grievance` dismissA `, remedies` (rf FALSE FALSE 0 10000 15000))'s `barred by a trial provision or the threshold`
-- G04
g04 MEANS `the grievance position for` g01e `, grievance` g01g `, remedies` (rf TRUE FALSE 20 20000 15000)
